1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,333
StudyHub: For HNU FCSIT students: your level’s courses, tasks and archive.

2
00:00:06,433 --> 00:00:14,933
Sign up as an FCSIT student.
Students of the faculty get the archive, college tasks and announcements.

3
00:00:15,167 --> 00:00:17,533
Enter the faculty code.
It is shared in your class group.

4
00:00:17,633 --> 00:00:25,167
Pick your level and program.
This decides which courses, tasks and announcements you get.

5
00:00:25,267 --> 00:00:33,333
Your overview, with college announcements.
The latest posts from your class channel, for your level and program.

6
00:00:33,433 --> 00:00:40,133
Your level’s courses and tasks arrive on their own.
Synced from HNU Board every few minutes, or right now with Sync now.

7
00:00:40,233 --> 00:00:45,400
All your level’s courses, already added.
Straight from the faculty’s course list for Level 4 · Robotics.

8
00:00:45,500 --> 00:00:49,900
Every assignment from the class channel.
With deadline, course and a link to the post.

9
00:00:50,000 --> 00:00:58,133
Open ones stay open, old ones show as closed.
Closed ones are not counted as your work in the weekly review.

10
00:00:58,233 --> 00:01:03,400
The college archive.
Lectures and files of every course, opened at your level.

11
00:01:03,500 --> 00:01:10,400
Open any lecture.
PDFs and slides from the archive, one click away.

12
00:01:10,500 --> 00:01:18,200
Link an archive course to yours.
Its files then show inside your course page.

13
00:01:18,267 --> 00:01:24,067
Changed level or program?.
Update it here any time.

14
00:01:24,167 --> 00:01:27,567
Everything else works like the general walkthrough.
Timetable, focus timer, notes, weekly review and the AI assistant.

15
00:01:30,633 --> 00:01:36,967
Happy studying! Website: study-joox-friends.loophole.site · Code: github.com/yousefJooX/studyhub
